sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Security Staff
    participant Service as StorageAllocationService
    participant Strategy as SuitableSizeStrategy
    participant DB as MongoDB (PyMongo)

    Staff->>Service: assign_storage(pkg_id)
    Service->>DB: find({is_active: true})
    DB-->>Service: active shelves [Shelf A, Shelf B, ...]
    Service->>Strategy: rank(candidates, pkg.size)
    Note over Strategy: Evaluates best-fit bounding box & free slots
    Strategy-->>Service: ranked shelf IDs [Shelf B-02 (best), ...]
    Note over Service: Atomic Conditional Slot Reservation (CAS)
    Service->>DB: find_one_and_update({id: B-02, occupied_count < capacity}, {$inc: {occupied_count: 1}})
    DB-->>Service: updated shelf document (Reservation Success)
    Service->>DB: update_one(package, {shelf_id: B-02, status: STORED})
    Service-->>Staff: 200 OK (Assigned Shelf "B-02")
